WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit tall on a block or cushion.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Place one hand behind and the other on the outer thigh or chair.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Lengthen, then twist open — not into the belly.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep breath easy.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Unwind and switch.
